{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>להבין</b> — משל ומליצה וחידות: a משל is one from which another matter goes forth; a חידה is a hidden thing, and it is not understood until it is explained, as stated: 'הלא אלה כלם עליו משל ישאו ולקח יקרא כן' — on account of what a person takes from knowledge. And similarly: 'מה יקחך לבך' — and תחבולות means counsel and thought, as testified: 'מחשבות צדיקים משפט' etc. And similarly: 'חובליך' — the meaning is 'תחבולות יקנה,' because one will understand משל and מליצה and the words of other sages."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {0 "The second verse quotation ('מה יקחך לבך') could not be identified as a biblical verse and may reflect a corrupt or paraphrased citation in the source."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:20:43.608326253Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}